Description: Kulan Files: status bar, preview pane, Finder-style sidebar
 - A status bar at the bottom of the window: the open folder's path on the
   left ("Home › Documents › Projects"), and "12 items, 41 GB available" or
   "3 of 12 selected (2.1 MB)" on the right (replacing the floating bar for
   selections; it still shows while a folder loads).
 - A preview pane on the right (Shift+Ctrl+P or the toolbar button) with a
   large thumbnail, name, kind, Kulan tags, size, dates, location and Open;
   remembered in org.kulan.desktop files-preview-pane when that exists.
 - The sidebar in Favourites (Home, Recent, Starred, Desktop, bookmarks),
   Locations (cloud, disks, Network, Trash) and Tags (one row per tag in
   use, from ~/.local/share/kulan/tag-folders), with headings.
Author: Kulan OS <https://github.com/mmohamud25/kulan-os>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-22
